# Data tables — TanStack Table

Whenever you add or change a **data table** (rows of entities with columns, search, filters, or pagination), use **`@tanstack/react-table`** plus the shared **`components/data-table/`** primitives. Do not hand-roll `<table>` markup with `.map()` over rows unless the UI is a tiny static layout (e.g. 2–3 fixed rows inside a dialog).

## Required stack

- `useReactTable` + column defs in `useMemo<ColumnDef<RowType, unknown>[]>(...)`
- `getCoreRowModel()` always
- `getFilteredRowModel()` when search or column filters exist
- `getPaginationRowModel()` when the list can grow beyond one screen
- `useCrmTableFeatures()` for column resize + client or server sort

## Shared UI primitives (`components/data-table/`)

Use these instead of duplicating table markup:

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `CrmDataTable` | Table shell: scroll wrapper, header/body, skeleton, empty state, optional row click |
| `CrmDataTableHead` / `CrmDataTableCell` | Sortable headers + standard cell padding (used inside `CrmDataTable`) |
| `CrmDataTableLayout` | Optional `Card` wrapper (`asCard={false}` inside tab panels) |
| `CrmDataTableToolbar` | Responsive toolbar row for search + filters |
| `CrmDataTableSearch` | Labeled search input (optional icon) |
| `CrmDataTablePageSize` | “Rows per page” select — **toolbar**, options `[10, 15, 25, 50]` |
| `CrmDataTableRowCount` | `{count} {noun}(s)` with optional `(filtered)` |
| `CrmDataTablePagination` | Footer: `Page X of Y` + outline prev/next buttons |

Import from `@/components/data-table` (barrel).

## File layout

- Prefer a dedicated `*-list-table.tsx` (or `*-table.tsx`) component; keep the page thin (data fetch + dialog/actions).
- Mark client components with `'use client'`.

## Reference implementations

Copy structure from:

- `app/crm/project/project-list-table.tsx` — `CrmDataTableLayout` + search + page size + pagination
- `app/crm/inquiry/inquiry-list-table.tsx` — stage tabs, column filters, toolbar, pagination with row count
- `app/crm/inventory/inventory-list-table.tsx` — filters inside tab card (`asCard={false}`), clickable rows

## Column patterns

```tsx
const columns = useMemo<ColumnDef<MyRow, unknown>[]>(
  () => [
    {
      id: 'name',
      header: 'Name',
      accessorKey: 'name', // or accessorFn
      cell: ({ row }) => <span>{row.original.name}</span>
    },
    {
      id: 'actions',
      header: 'Actions',
      enableGlobalFilter: false,
      enableSorting: false,
      cell: ({ row }) => (
        <TableRowActions
          actions={[
            /* ≤2 → inline outline buttons; >2 → ⋯ menu */
            { id: 'view', label: 'View', href: `/crm/…/${row.original.id}` },
            { id: 'edit', label: 'Edit', onClick: () => onEdit(row.original) }
          ]}
        />
      )
    }
  ],
  [deps]
);
```

## Row actions

- Use `TableViewButton` for a single View/Open action.
- Use `TableRowActions` (`components/buttons/table-row-actions.tsx`) when a row has one or more actions.
- **≤2 actions**: render as consistent outline/default `size="sm"` buttons.
- **>2 actions**: collapse into a single `⋯` dropdown menu (do not show more than two inline buttons).
- Prefer `header: 'Actions'`; keep `enableGlobalFilter: false` and `enableSorting: false`.

## Standard list table assembly

```tsx
<CrmDataTableLayout asCard={/* true for standalone lists */}>
  <CrmDataTableToolbar>
    <CrmDataTableSearch id="…" value={globalFilter} onChange={setGlobalFilter} />
    {/* domain filters */}
    <CrmDataTableRowCount count={filteredCount} noun="project" filtered={isFiltered} />
    <CrmDataTablePageSize table={table} />
  </CrmDataTableToolbar>

  <CrmDataTable
    className="mt-4"
    table={table}
    columnCount={columns.length}
    loading={loading}
    dataLength={rows.length}
    emptyState={{ title: 'No rows found', description: '…' }}
  />

  <CrmDataTablePagination table={table} />
</CrmDataTableLayout>
```

Tables without pagination (e.g. server-paginated parent) use `CrmDataTable` body only.

## Search and filters

- **Global search**: `globalFilter` state + custom `FilterFn` on the row type (see `globalProjectFilter` / `globalInquiryFilter`).
- **Column filters**: `columnFilters` state + `FilterFn` per column when needed.
- Wire search via `CrmDataTableSearch` or `onGlobalFilterChange` / `setGlobalFilter`.

## Pagination and empty states

- Default `pageSize: 10`; offer **10 / 15 / 25 / 50** via `CrmDataTablePageSize` in the **toolbar**.
- Footer nav via `CrmDataTablePagination` (always visible; outline `size-8` prev/next).
- Loading: `CrmDataTable` shows `CrmTableBodySkeleton` when `loading && dataLength === 0`.
- Empty: title + description via `emptyState` prop; add CTA in `emptyState.action` when relevant.

## Styling and UX

- `CrmDataTable` wraps content in `overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border` with `min-w-[56rem]` (override via `minTableWidth`).
- Standard typography: `text-sm` cells, `text-xs` headers — do not override with `text-[10px]` unless a documented exception.
- Use design tokens (`ds-gray-*`, `ds-primary-*`, `Card`, `Button`) — match existing CRM tables.
- Row actions in an `actions` column; avoid hover-only controls.

## Exceptions

- **Member/settings sub-tables** inside a dialog with &lt;10 rows and no search/pagination may stay a simple `<table>`.
- **Pivot/grid layouts** (e.g. inventory floor grid, payment schedule) are not list tables — do not force TanStack list primitives.
- **Matrix tables** (e.g. booking documents matrix) may use `CrmDataTable` body only without pagination.
